SUMMARY:ULTRA SUNN & Supports (Uhrzeit prüfen)
LOCATION:Flucc
DESCRIPTION:@WANNE | In the heart of Brussels\, ULTRA SUNN emerged as one of the most vital voices of the new darkwave generation. Formed in 2019 by vocalist and multi-instrumentalist Sam Huge and keyboardist/producer Gaelle Souflet\, the duo quickly carved their own space between heritage and modernity\, between the shadows of Belgium's electronic legacy and the urgent light of the present moment and echoing far beyond the city that birthed it.  ULTRA SUNN's sound draws from the DNA of the Sound of Belgium\, the industrial rigor of EBM\, the strangeness of New Beat\, the nocturnal melancholy of Coldwave. Yet they refuse nostalgia. Instead\, they distill these elements into sharp\, modern anthems\, carried by Sam's commanding baritone voice and Gaelle's hypnotic synth textures. Their music is both vulnerable and defiant\, embedding themes of mental health\, identity\, and empowerment within luminous melodies and pounding beats. This rare duality\, strength and fragility\, underground grit and pop immediacy\, propelled them onto stages alongside Front 242\, DAF\, and collaborations with Front Line Assembly\, as well as newer torchbearers like Twin Tribes and Kontravoid. Their reputation grew not only as musicians\, but as performers who transform every show into ritual: bodies moving as one in the shadows\, a communion of lights\, voices\, and vulnerability.   Today\, ULTRA SUNN are not just a band but a phenomenon.  They embody the promise of a generation that looks backward only to leap forward\, transforming EBM and coldwave into something urgent\, global\, and alive.  ++ supports:  SYDNEY VALETTE  Through a varied and progressive career spanning several styles of electronic music\, Sydney Valette upholds the highest levels of vision and discipline. He is renowned for being among the most dynamic and captivating solo acts\, setting a standard in electronic music performance.  SAD MADONA is a solo-project from Paris\, France\, fusing elements of darkwave\, coldwave\, post-punk\,and shoegaze to create a captivating and emotive sound that he describes as "dramatic dance."  LINE UP Ultra Sunn (BEL) + Supports: Sydney Valette & Sad Madona ----------------------------------------------------------------- presented by Generation Noir 23€ 
